LICENCE OF THE PARTNER KIT: NOT YET CHOSEN.

The copyright holder (the study lead) decides the licence before the kit is sent to any partner.
Proposed: the MIT licence (permissive; allows a partner's legal office to approve the code without a software agreement),
with this research-use statement: "For research use only. Not a medical device. Not for clinical decision-making."
Until this file holds a licence text, the kit must not be distributed.
